  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ソニアはかせが　しゅっぱん　した。\nガラルちほうの　でんせつに　ついての\nしんはっけんが　おもしろく　かかれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "소니아박사가 출판했다.\n가라르지방의 전설에 대한\n새로운 발견이 흥미롭게 쓰여 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "索妮亞博士出版的書。\n書中以有趣的手法描述了\n關於伽勒爾地區傳說的新發現。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ouvrage publié par Professeure Sonya,\noù elle conte à sa manière les nouvelles découvertes\nfaites au sujet des légendes de Galar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Buch wurde von Professor Sania herausgebracht.\nEs ist eine unterhaltsam geschriebene Abhandlung über\nneue Erkenntnisse zu Legenden der Galar-Region.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Publicación de la Profesora Sonia que trata de forma\namena los recientes descubrimientos sobre las leyendas\nde la región de Galar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pubblicazione della Professoressa Sonia.\nRaccoglie tutte le ultime scoperte riguardanti le\nleggende di Galar in un libro scorrevole e informativo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Professor Sonia’s published writings. Her new\ndiscoveries about the Galar region’s legends are\nrecorded in this enjoyable read.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ソニア博士が　出版　した。\nガラル地方の　伝説に　ついての\n新発見が　おもしろく　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "索妮亚博士出版的书。\n以风趣的文笔展示了\n关于伽勒尔地区传说的最新发现。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Publicación de la Profesora Sonia que trata de forma\namena los recientes descubrimientos sobre las leyendas\nde la región de Galar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
